{"id":"6b32588f9bb461b3","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-measure-atoms.md","title":"概率测度的原子与连续性","display":"df-measure-atoms — 概率测度的原子与连续性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-measure-atoms","aliases":["43-df-measure-atoms"],"display":"df-measure-atoms — 概率测度的原子与连续性","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-measure]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.9.1，Definition 9.9.1之后，印刷198，PDF218","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-measure-atoms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-measure-atoms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measure-atoms — 概率测度的原子与连续性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.9.1，Definition 9.9.1之后，印刷198，PDF218"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\mathcal B\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\nu:\\mathcal B\\to[0,1]\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(2^\\omega,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(2^\\omega,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span> 及概率测度上的布尔谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\coloneqq\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\nu(\\{X\\})&gt;0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\coloneqq\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\nu(\\{X\\})&gt;0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AtomicMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AtomicMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ContinuousMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ContinuousMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TrivialMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\exists E\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\left(E=\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\land\\nu(E)=1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TrivialMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\exists E\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\left(E=\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\land\\nu(E)=1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NontrivialMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\exists E\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\left(E=\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\land\\nu(E)&lt;1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NontrivialMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\exists E\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\left(E=\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\land\\nu(E)&lt;1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿用原书术语：atomic表示至少有一个原子，trivial表示全部质量集中在原子上；这两者不同。概率测度的原子至多可数：每个正整数k只容许有限多个质量至少1/k的点，故Atoms(ν)是Borel可测集。continuous在此意为无原子，不表示测度函数在某个未声明函数空间中的连续性。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.9.1，Definition 9.9.1之后，印刷198，PDF218。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地推广或推论已单独注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。$\\nu:\\mathcal B\\to[0,1]$ 满足 [[43-df-measure]] 的 $\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(2^\\omega,\\mathcal B,\\nu)$，$X\\in2^\\omega$。下式定义 $\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 及概率测度上的布尔谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。$\\nu:\\mathcal B\\to[0,1]$ 满足 [[43-df-measure]] 的 $\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(2^\\omega,\\mathcal B,\\nu)$，$X\\in2^\\omega$。下式定义 $\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 及概率测度上的布尔谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu:\\mathcal B\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(2^\\omega,\\mathcal B,\\nu)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\coloneqq\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\nu(\\{X\\})>0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AtomicMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ContinuousMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TrivialMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\exists E\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\left(E=\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\land\\nu(E)=1\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NontrivialMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\exists E\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\left(E=\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\land\\nu(E)<1\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1916,"backlinks":[{"id":"47c9273664941e32","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是Cantor空间Borel概率测度，$I_\\nu$ 见 [[43-df-measure-interval]]，$\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)$ 见 [[43-df-measure-atoms]]。以下以图定义 $\\operatorname{real}_\\nu$ 与 $\\operatorname{seq}_\\nu$，其定义域分别为 $E_\\nu\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 与 $D_\\nu\\subseteq[0,1]$；$\\exists!$ 为唯一存在量词。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-246","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-measure-atoms]] — 概率测度的原子与连续性"},{"id":"0e7016d5e6e71f46","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是满足 $\\operatorname{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)$ 的Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$。可计算测度、原子、柱集及 $\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)$ 见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]、[[43-df-computable]]；$X$ 视为自然数域上的总二值函数。"},{"id":"38b337ed607def8b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是可计算Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$ 且 $\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)$；相关定义见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]、[[43-df-mltestnu]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。"},{"id":"620117fc884bad92","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 为可计算Borel概率测度且 $\\operatorname{ContinuousMeasure}(\\nu)$，$A\\in2^\\omega$。$\\equiv_T$ 按二进制序列与特征集合识别解释；相关定义见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"7f929e689547cc3b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是可计算Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)$、$\\operatorname{MLTest}_\\nu$、$\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu$ 见 [[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-mltestnu]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]。"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1","8e999d59227f4a28"]}